  "abstract_summary": "Research on computational methods for pediatric solid tumors is constrained by data scarcity, a focus on single tumor types, and the limits of imaging alone. We present FusionSwinUNETR, a multimodal segmentation model that conditions a SwinUNETRv2 backbone on patient metadata and clinician-written findings alongside...",
